requirements:
Prerequisite: 
CHEM 1A with minimum grades of C-; 
or CHEM 4A with minimum grade of C-; 
or AP Chem with minimum score of 4; 
or Chem HL IB with minimum score of 5; 
or GCE A-Level Chem with minimum grade of C.

Corequisite: BIOLOGY 1A.

Recommended: CHEM 3A or CHEM 12A
with minimum grade of C-.

1.	Audition 
2.	Satisfactory performance in musicianship placement test and intent to major in music; or have already declared major in music.
3.	Commitment to:	
a.	study a broad variety of styles and periods of notated keyboard literature, spanning pre-Baroque era through 21st century;
b.	participate in planning of varied repertoire with private instructor and supervising faculty;
